ergo.dev/fluid is an Ergo port of the design of Fluid Functionalism.
Its Ergo text is new work. It takes the original's design and values
(colours, sizes, radii, shadows, spring timings) under the licence below.

1. Fluid Functionalism (the original design and its values)
