2. The reference for behaviour and structure
   Fluid Functionalism for Foldkit, by Tim Hanlon,
   https://github.com/timhanlon/fluid-functionalism-foldkit at commit a8fdcc03,
   with its docs at https://fff.timhanlon.com. This port reads it for how the
   components behave and how they are built. It copies no text from it.

